    Local-manifest seed for AOSP repo workspaces that mirror this repository.
    Replace the remote fetch URL with the parent directory or Git remote for
    this repository before use. For a plain local checkout, prefer
    sw/aosp-device/import-aosp-device.sh.
  -->
  <remote name="openphone-local" fetch="file:///REPLACE_WITH_OPENPHONE_REPO_PARENT" />
